                      "v": " Thus the pride of man has become a chasm, both deep and wide, says The Lord. Therefore, says The Lord your Redeemer, The Holy One of Israel: Tear down the temple of God, and I shall raise it up again. And of those who are Mine I shall not lose one, for I AM The Temple of God. (An excerpt from \"The Judgment of God Is True and Without Question, Yet the Error of the People Is Great\" - "
