                      "v": "Beloved children, you have rejected Life! You have turned your backs on Forgiveness! WHY HAVE YOU FORSAKEN ME?! My heart bleeds with sorrow, as I look upon the works of your hands! Anguish grabs hold of Me, as I search your hearts and minds! Deep mourning fills Me, as I stretch out My hand to bring destruction upon you!... Great and bitter sorrows, unending grief, My children have departed from Me."
