                "t": "bold-italic",
                "v": "For the Holy Days are revelation, revealing hidden things kept secret since the world began — signposts of things to come, a foretaste of The Kingdom, a glimpse into the Glory of God even as the Scriptures, unfolding and coming to light as the will of God is manifest."
