          "Matthew 12:12": "Of how much more value then is a man than a sheep? Therefore it is lawful to do good on the Sabbath.”",
          "Luke 16:17": "And it is easier for heaven and earth to pass away than for one tittle of the law to fail.",
          "Luke 23:55-56": "55. And the women who had come with Him from Galilee followed after, and they observed the tomb and how His body was laid. 56. Then they returned and prepared spices and fragrant oils. And they rested on the Sabbath according to the commandment.",
